label Greeting
Danilo: [shake rate=20 level=10]Uy, hello! Kumbaga... I've been watching your store for like, three hours already? Actually even before you opened. Gist is, I needed to check if the, you know, "vibes" was right.
Danilo: Lowkey been seeing you interact with people and I was like, "Wait, this store is a prime spot." Kumbaga... if I sit here I can see the whole crossroads and the canal too.
Danilo: Speaking of crossroads, did you see the last person here? Kumbaga, that was {Global.LastCustomer}, right? I heard they were looking for something... suspicious. Just saying!
Danilo: Actually, before I start my shift—watching, I mean—I need something to keep my energy up. You got anything good? Something that makes you feel like you have, you know, four eyes? Or just a regular snack?

label Rumor
Danilo: [shake]Kumbaga... Kuya Kap was acting weird earlier. I saw him near the balete tree just staring at the roots. Actually, for ten minutes! Problematic, right?

label Talk
Danilo: Actually, what's taking so long? Kumbaga if I don't get my snack I might miss something important happening at the plaza.
Danilo: [shake]Gist is, Buboy is currently annoying Manang Ana. Lowkey I should be there to record it but I'm hungry.
- Speed it up!
	Danilo: I'm trying! Kumbaga... patience is not really my thing when there's gossip to be had.
- Just wait.
	Danilo: Lowkey rude, but fine. Kumbaga... I'll just count the bricks on your wall while you work.
- [Refuse service]
	[signal arg="pulse_red"]
	Danilo: [shake]Wait, what? Kumbaga... you’re just gonna kick me out? Gist is, I was gonna share the juicy stuff with you! Lowkey unfair. Fine!
	[end_timeline]

label Satisfy
[signal arg="pulse_green"]
Danilo: [shake]Yes! Perfect! Kumbaga... this is exactly what I needed to keep my focus sharp. Gist is, I’ll be around. Actually, I’ll be *everywhere*.
set {Danilo.Trust} += 1
Danilo: See ya later! Lowkey don't tell anyone I was here spying... I mean, hanging out!
[end_timeline]

label Partial
Danilo: [shake]Kumbaga... this is only half of what I asked for? Actually, I can't see the full picture if I only have half a snack! Hurry up!

label WrongItem
Danilo: [shake]Wait, what is this? Kumbaga... this wasn't on the list? Gist is, I needed a snack, not a distraction! Lowkey weird.

label ItemDiscovery
Danilo: [wave]Uy! Is that a new item? Kumbaga... I heard a rumor that this was imported from the realm of—wait, actually, just from the city. Lowkey cool though.
